@base = http://localhost:8081

### 1 GET列表：查询参数绑定
GET {{base}}/api/menus?page=0&size=5&keyword=exp09

### 2 POST创建：请求体绑定，预期201+Location+统一Result
POST {{base}}/api/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{"dishName":"exp09-青椒肉丝","price":20.50}

### 3 GET详情：路径变量绑定（替换实际ID）
GET {{base}}/api/menus/7

### 4 PUT修改
PUT {{base}}/api/menus/7
Content-Type: application/json

{"dishName":"exp09-青椒肉丝改","price":22.00}

### 5 DELETE单个
DELETE {{base}}/api/menus/7

### 6 批量ID List<Long>绑定
DELETE {{base}}/api/menus?ids=8,9

### 错误URL1：动作写进路径；改为 GET /api/menus/{id}
GET {{base}}/getMenuById?id=1

### 错误URL2：create动词；改为 POST /api/menus
POST {{base}}/createMenu
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 错误URL3：delete动词+查询ID；改为 DELETE /api/menus/{id}
DELETE {{base}}/deleteMenu?id=1
